      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i accidentally splashed some of that heavy duty dish soap in my eye while doing dishes. it stings a bit and looks kinda red but i dont want to go to the doctor if i dont have to. i have some old antibiotic eye drops in my medicine cabinet from last year, would it be a good idea to put those in now just to make sure the soap doesnt cause an infection?",
